#### condition position stays boolean

#### takes the false branch for an absent Option

- Verify: takes the false branch for an absent Option


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: takes the false branch for an absent Option")
val opt: Option<text> = None
var taken = "none"
if opt.?:
    taken = "then"
else:
    taken = "else"
expect taken == "else"
```

</details>

