Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: does not enter a while loop guarded by an absent Option")
val absent: Option<text> = None
var iterations = 0
while absent.?:
    iterations = iterations + 1
    if iterations > 2:
        break
expect iterations == 0
```

